            "review_title": "Review at Burger Wang Nha Trang",
            "review_text": "Grace kim\nDa Lat, Vietnam47 contributions\n0\nBest handmade burgers and super cozy bar upstairs!\nNov 2025 • Family\nI visited Burger Wang during my trip to Nha Trang and ended up going back again because it was so good. The burgers are made fresh and you can really taste the quality. The flavors were spot on, and everything came out hot and perfectly cooked.\n\nWhat surprised me the most was the second floor. There’s a small bar area with a really cozy vibe, plus foosball, beer pong, and soft darts, which made it a fun place to hang out after eating. They also have a nice selection of beers and soft drinks.\n\nIf you like milkshakes, definitely try the peanut shake. It was honestly one of the best I’ve had anywhere — super creamy and unique.\n\nOverall, great food, friendly atmosphere, and a fun place to relax. Highly recommend stopping by if you're in Nha Trang!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten November 10, 2025",
            "rating": 5.0,
